#. translators: Admin notice explaining how to enable PayPal Advanced Card Payments. HTML <br> tags are intentional for formatting.
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:747
msgid ""
"To use Advanced Card Payments, ensure your PayPal account is eligible and enabled:<br><br>\n"
"                <strong>Steps:</strong><br>\n"
"                1. Visit developer.paypal.com → Apps & Credentials → API Credentials.<br>\n"
"                2. Click your App Name.<br>\n"
"                3. Under \"Features\" → Accept Payments, check if \"Advanced Credit and Debit Card Payments\" is enabled.<br>\n"
"                4. If missing, your account or region may not support it."
msgstr ""
"若要使用高級卡付款，請確保您的 PayPal 帳戶符合資格並已啟用：<br><br>\n"
"                <strong>步驟：</strong><br>\n"
"                1. 造訪developer.paypal.com → 應用程式和憑證 → API Credentials.<br>\n"
"                2. 按一下您的應用程式名稱。 <br>\n"
"                3. 在「功能」→接受付款下，檢查「進階信用卡和金融卡付款」是否已啟用。 <br>\n"
"                4. 如果缺少，可能是您的帳戶或地區不支援。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:824
msgid "Fastlane by PayPal"
msgstr "PayPal 快速通道"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:826
msgid "Fastlane offers an accelerated guest checkout: returning Fastlane members are recognized by their email address, verify with a one-time code and pay with their saved card — no typing, no account needed on your store. New customers can enroll during checkout. Fastlane requires Advanced Card Processing and is currently available to US merchants transacting in USD."
msgstr "Fastlane 提供加速賓客結帳的服務：返回的 Fastlane 會員可透過他們的電子郵件地址進行識別，使用一次性代碼進行驗證，並使用已儲存的卡進行支付 - 無需打字，無需在您的商店開設帳戶。新客戶可以在結帳時註冊。 Fastlane 需要高級卡片處理，目前可供以美元進行交易的美國商家使用。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:830
msgid "Enable Fastlane by PayPal"
msgstr "透過 PayPal 啟用 Fastlane"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:833
msgid "Adds Fastlane accelerated checkout to the Advanced Credit/Debit Card gateway. Shoppers who enter a Fastlane member email address are offered a one-time-code login and can pay with their saved card in a couple of clicks."
msgstr "將 Fastlane 加速結帳新增至進階信用卡/金融卡閘道。輸入 Fastlane 會員電子郵件地址的購物者將獲得一次性代碼登錄，只需點擊幾下即可使用已儲存的卡片進行付款。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:837
msgid "Fastlane Flow"
msgstr "快車道流程"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:842
msgid "Email Detection"
msgstr "電子郵件偵測"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:843
msgid "Express Button"
msgstr "快速按鈕"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:845
msgid "Email Detection (recommended by PayPal): Fastlane engages automatically when the customer enters a member email address. Express Button: a Fastlane button is shown in the express checkout section at the top of the checkout page and the customer starts Fastlane by clicking it."
msgstr "電子郵件偵測（PayPal 推薦）：當客戶輸入會員電子郵件地址時，Fastlane 會自動啟用。快速按鈕：快速通道按鈕顯示在結帳頁面頂部的快速結帳部分，客戶透過點擊該按鈕啟動快速通道。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:849
msgid "Authenticate On Page Load"
msgstr "在頁面載入時進行身份驗證"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:850
msgid "Start Fastlane authentication when the checkout page loads"
msgstr "結帳頁面載入時啟動 Fastlane 驗證"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:857
msgid "Fastlane Watermark"
msgstr "快車道浮水印"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:858
msgid "Show the \"Fastlane by PayPal\" watermark under the email field"
msgstr "在電子郵件欄位下顯示「Fastlane by PayPal」浮水印"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:861
msgid "Displays the Fastlane watermark below the billing email field so customers know their email address is checked against Fastlane. Recommended by PayPal."
msgstr "在帳單電子郵件欄位下方顯示 Fastlane 浮水印，以便客戶知道他們的電子郵件地址已根據 Fastlane 進行檢查。由貝寶推薦。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:865
msgid "Email Field At Top"
msgstr "頂部電子郵件字段"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:866
msgid "Move the email address field to the top of the billing form"
msgstr "將電子郵件地址欄位移至帳單表單頂部"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:869
msgid "Fastlane recognizes customers by their email address, so asking for it first gives returning members the fastest possible checkout. Applies to the classic checkout form; the block checkout already asks for the email address first."
msgstr "Fastlane 透過電子郵件地址來識別顧客，因此首先詢問電子郵件地址可以讓回頭客以最快的速度結帳。適用於經典結帳形式；區塊結帳已經首先要求提供電子郵件地址。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:873
msgid "Fastlane Signup Link"
msgstr "Fastlane 註冊鏈接"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:874
msgid "Show a \"Pay faster with Fastlane\" link to non-members"
msgstr "向非會員顯示「使用 Fastlane 更快付款」鏈接"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:877
msgid "When the entered email address is not a Fastlane member, show a link above the card fields that lets the customer enter their card through Fastlane and join for faster future checkouts."
msgstr "當輸入的電子郵件地址不是 Fastlane 會員時，請在卡字段上方顯示一個鏈接，讓客戶透過 Fastlane 輸入卡並加入，以便將來更快結帳。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1950
msgid "Authorized Order Status"
msgstr "授權訂單狀態"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1953
msgid "If the transaction is authorized, this status will be applied to the order."
msgstr "如果交易獲得授權​​，該狀態將應用於訂單。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1959
msgid "Capture Order Statuses"
msgstr "捕捉訂單狀態"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1962
msgid "Authorized payments will be captured when the order moves to one of these statuses."
msgstr "當訂單轉至其中一種狀態時，將捕獲授權付款。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1966
msgid "Select order statuses"
msgstr "選擇訂單狀態"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2037
msgid "Auto-complete paid orders"
msgstr "自動完成已付款訂單"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2039
msgid "Mark orders as \"Completed\" after successful payment"
msgstr "付款成功後將訂單標記為“已完成”"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2042
msgid "WooCommerce normally sets Processing for physical products. Enable this only if you want all successful orders to become Completed automatically."
msgstr "WooCommerce 通常會為實體產品設定處理。僅當您希望所有成功訂單自動完成時才啟用此選項。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2056
msgid "API Cache"
msgstr "API快取"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2058
msgid "Clear all cached PayPal API responses (access tokens, client tokens, merchant status). Use this after changing credentials or if payments are failing unexpectedly."
msgstr "清除所有快取的 PayPal API 回應（存取權杖、客戶端令牌、商家狀態）。在更改憑證後或付款意外失敗時使用此選項。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2062
msgid "3D Secure / SCA"
msgstr "3D 安全/SCA"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2064
msgid "Control how your store handles 3D Secure (Strong Customer Authentication) results for credit card payments. The recommended \"Smart\" mode blocks only cards that fail their bank's authentication challenge — the typical stolen-card signal behind fraud chargebacks — while letting all other payments through, so legitimate sales are not affected."
msgstr "控制您的商店如何處理信用卡付款的 3D 安全性（強客戶身份驗證）結果。建議的「智慧」模式僅阻止未通過銀行身份驗證挑戰的卡片（詐欺退款背後的典型被盜卡訊號），同時允許所有其他付款通過，因此合法銷售不會受到影響。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2067
msgid "Liability Shift Handling"
msgstr "責任轉移處理"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2070
msgid "How to handle credit card payments based on their 3D Secure result. \"Smart\" (recommended) only stops payments where the cardholder failed or could not complete the bank authentication challenge, and lets the shopper retry — this blocks most stolen-card fraud without declining legitimate customers. \"Accept\" processes every payment (legacy behavior, least protection). \"Review\" processes all payments but records the 3DS result on the order for your own monitoring. \"Reject\" declines any payment that does not receive a successful liability shift (strictest, but will decline some legitimate cards that are not enrolled in 3D Secure)."
msgstr "如何根據 3D Secure 結果處理信用卡付款。 「智慧」（建議）僅在持卡人失敗或無法完成銀行身份驗證質詢時停止付款，並讓購物者重試 - 這可以阻止大多數被盜卡欺詐，而不會拒絕合法客戶。 「接受」處理每筆付款（遺留行為，最少的保護）。 「審核」會處理所有付款，但會在訂單上記錄 3DS 結果，以便您可以自己監控。 「拒絕」會拒絕任何未成功完成責任轉移的付款（最嚴格，但會拒絕某些未註冊 3D Secure 的合法卡）。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2074
msgid "Smart — Recommended: block only failed bank authentications, allow everything else"
msgstr "智慧 — 推薦：僅阻止失敗的銀行身份驗證，允許其他所有內容"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2075
msgid "Accept — Process all payments (legacy, least protection)"
msgstr "接受 - 處理所有付款（遺留、最低保護）"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2076
msgid "Review — Process all payments but record the 3DS result for monitoring"
msgstr "審核 — 處理所有付款，但記錄 3DS 結果以供監控"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2077
msgid "Reject — Decline any payment without a successful liability shift (strictest)"
msgstr "拒絕 — 在沒有成功的責任轉移的情況下拒絕任何付款（最嚴格）"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2081
msgid "3D Secure Logging"
msgstr "3D 安全記錄"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2083
msgid "Log 3D Secure evaluation details"
msgstr "記錄 3D Secure 評估詳細信息"

#. translators: %s is the path to the 3DS log file.
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2088
#, php-format
msgid "Log 3D Secure liability shift decisions inside %s"
msgstr "在 %s 內記錄 3D 安全責任轉移決策"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2093
msgid "Fraud Protection (reCAPTCHA v3)"
msgstr "詐欺保護 (reCAPTCHA v3)"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2095
msgid "Protect your checkout from bots and card testing fraud using Google reCAPTCHA v3. This is completely invisible to legitimate customers."
msgstr "使用 Google reCAPTCHA v3 保護您的結帳免受機器人和卡片測試詐欺的侵害。這對於合法客戶來說是完全看不見的。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2098
msgid "Enable reCAPTCHA"
msgstr "啟用驗證碼"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2100
msgid "Enable reCAPTCHA v3 fraud protection at checkout"
msgstr "結帳時啟用 reCAPTCHA v3 詐欺保護"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2103
msgid "When enabled, checkout submissions are scored by Google reCAPTCHA v3. Suspicious submissions are blocked before reaching PayPal. No impact on legitimate customers."
msgstr "啟用後，結帳提交將由 Google reCAPTCHA v3 進行評分。可疑提交內容在到達 PayPal 之前會被封鎖。對合法客戶沒有影響。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2106
msgid "reCAPTCHA Site Key"
msgstr "reCAPTCHA 站點金鑰"

#. translators: %s: URL to the Google reCAPTCHA admin console.
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2110
#, php-format
msgid "Get your reCAPTCHA v3 keys from the <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Google reCAPTCHA admin console</a>."
msgstr "從 <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Google reCAPTCHA 管理控制台取得您的 reCAPTCHA v3 金鑰</a>。"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2116
